#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/slc/01-getting-started/output_4.png)\n"
msgstr "![Diagram Circuit kuantum](/img/qiskit-addons/slc/01-getting-started/output_4.png)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/slc/01-getting-started/output_5.png)\n"
